IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-versions`

-- Tests of sgta-i-versions.l4.  Every expected value is computed from the rule as the module header states it (the latest published day among the versions
-- published on or before the reading day whose effective day is on or before the conduct day) applied to the published and effective days read from the
-- e-Gazette copies, not read back from the L4.  Every case is a pair of days: CONDUCT first, READING second.  Each version is tested on each side of its
-- effective day and of its published day, and a reader before the version existed is tested as well.

§ `N 1: each version on each side of its published and effective days, and as read today`
